  <data name="EffectParam_RTXVideo_RTXVideo_VSR_category_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Choose Standard, High bitrate, or Streaming upscaling for your content, or same-size Denoise/Deblur. Each category remembers its settings; Streaming requires Ampere or newer. Restart scaling to apply changes.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_RTXVideo_RTXVideo_VSR_strength_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Selects the processing level for the current category; Streaming offers Medium/Ultra. Switches live; loading a model may cause a brief wait.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_RTXVideo_RTXVideo_Denoise_strength_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Selects a denoising level. Start at Medium and adjust the balance of grain reduction and retained detail. Switches live; loading a model may cause a brief wait.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_NvidiaVFX_Upscale_sharpness_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Enhances edge definition after upscaling; excessive values can produce halos, while 0 applies scaling alone. Applies live.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_NvidiaVFX_VFG_model_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Performance favors lower processing cost; Balanced uses a more complex model. Switches live; loading a model may cause a brief wait.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_NvidiaVFX_VFG_multiplier_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Sets the target output multiplier relative to the base frame rate. Higher multipliers cost more processing; actual output depends on hardware and display pacing. Restart scaling to apply changes.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_NvidiaVFX_VFG_automaticShotDetection_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Detects shot changes and reuses the current image at a cut to keep scene transitions clear. Restart scaling to apply changes.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_RTXVideo_RTXVideo_HDR_contrast_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Adjusts the contrast between light and dark areas. Applies live.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_RTXVideo_RTXVideo_HDR_saturation_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Adjusts color intensity. Applies live.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_RTXVideo_RTXVideo_HDR_middleGray_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Adjusts midtone brightness. Applies live.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_RTXVideo_RTXVideo_HDR_peakNits_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Sets target highlight brightness; match it to the peak capability of the output display. Applies live.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_RTXVideo_RTXVideo_HDR_debanding_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Smooths steps in gradients to reduce banding. Applies live.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_FSR3FG_FSR3_FrameGeneration_opticalFlowMethod_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Estimates motion between consecutive frames for frame generation. AMDOF works across GPU vendors; NVOF requires a rendering GPU with NVIDIA optical-flow support. Restart scaling to apply changes.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_FSR3FG_FSR3_FrameGeneration_amdOpticalFlowMode_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Applies when AMDOF is selected. Performance favors lower cost; Quality uses more computation for motion estimation. Restart scaling to apply changes.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_FSR3FG_FSR3_FrameGeneration_nvidiaOpticalFlowQuality_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Applies when NVOF is selected. Higher levels use more computation for motion estimation. Restart scaling to apply changes.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_DLSSFG_DLSS_FrameGeneration_multiplier_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Sets the target output multiplier relative to the base frame rate. Higher multipliers cost more processing; actual output depends on hardware and display pacing. Restart scaling to apply changes.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_XeSSFG_XeSS_FrameGeneration_multiplier_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Sets the target output multiplier relative to the base frame rate. Higher multipliers cost more processing; actual output depends on hardware and display pacing. Restart scaling to apply changes.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_Color_HDR_to_SDR_mode_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Compatibility pair keeps restoration settings for a later SDR → HDR step; SDR display maps the image for direct SDR viewing. Restart scaling to apply changes.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_Color_HDR_to_SDR_whiteNits_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Sets the mapping reference white; together with the source HDR peak, it determines how the brightness range is distributed. Restart scaling to apply changes.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_Color_HDR_to_SDR_peakNits_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Sets the reference range for mapping source HDR highlights. Restart scaling to apply changes.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_Color_HDR_to_SDR_exposure_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Adjusts overall image brightness during conversion. Restart scaling to apply changes.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_Color_HDR_to_SDR_shoulder_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Adjusts highlight compression to change bright-area gradation and overall contrast. Restart scaling to apply changes.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_Color_SDR_to_HDR_mode_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Auto restores an upstream compatibility pair when present; otherwise it maps SDR using the white-point brightness. Paired restoration uses upstream settings. Restart scaling to apply changes.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_xBR_xBR_2x_paramXbrYWeight_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Adjusts the luminance weight used by small-detail protection; active when that option is enabled. Applies live.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_xBR_xBR_2x_paramXbrEqThreshold_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Sets the color-similarity threshold; higher values treat more color differences as similar. Applies live.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_xBR_xBR_2x_paramXbrLv2Coefficient_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Adjusts diagonal-edge detection criteria to change how diagonal outlines are reconstructed. Applies live.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_xBR_xBR_2x_paramPreserveSmallDetails_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Uses edge detection aimed at isolated pixels and thin lines to help retain small details. Applies live.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_xBR_xBR_3x_paramXbrYWeight_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Adjusts the luminance weight used by small-detail protection; active when that option is enabled. Applies live.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_xBR_xBR_3x_paramXbrEqThreshold_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Sets the color-similarity threshold; higher values treat more color differences as similar. Applies live.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_xBR_xBR_3x_paramXbrLv2Coefficient_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Adjusts diagonal-edge detection criteria to change how diagonal outlines are reconstructed. Applies live.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_xBR_xBR_3x_paramPreserveSmallDetails_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Uses edge detection aimed at isolated pixels and thin lines to help retain small details. Applies live.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_xBR_xBR_4x_paramXbrYWeight_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Adjusts the luminance weight used by small-detail protection; active when that option is enabled. Applies live.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_xBR_xBR_4x_paramXbrEqThreshold_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Sets the color-similarity threshold; higher values treat more color differences as similar. Applies live.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_xBR_xBR_4x_paramXbrLv2Coefficient_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Adjusts diagonal-edge detection criteria to change how diagonal outlines are reconstructed. Applies live.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_xBR_xBR_4x_paramPreserveSmallDetails_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Uses edge detection aimed at isolated pixels and thin lines to help retain small details. Applies live.</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_xBR_xBR_NoBlend_3x_paramXbrLv2Coefficient_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Adjusts diagonal-edge detection; reconstruction selects colors from the input palette. Applies live.</value></data>
