  <data name="Overlay_Profiler_GraphFPSHelp" xml:space="preserve"><value>Capture counts frames accepted under the current duplicate-filtering rules. Output includes generated content frames and excludes cursor/UI refreshes and old-image replays. Output uses backend-reported or submitted counts, not monitor scanout.</value></data>
  <data name="Overlay_Profiler_GraphIntervalHelp" xml:space="preserve"><value>Capture measures time between accepted input frames; output measures time between individual content submissions. Only actual per-frame timestamps are used, never 1000/FPS or the generation multiplier. Each 100 ms bucket retains its mean and peak.</value></data>
  <data name="Overlay_Profiler_GraphEffectsHelp" xml:space="preserve"><value>Measured effect total per valid sample, including samples with no effect work. The effect breakdown above averages each effect's executions, so its denominator may differ.</value></data>
